<title>FINLAND: UPM-Kymmene says buys Czech sack mill.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene says buys Czech sack mill.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy said in a statement on Tuesday its Walki Sack business unit had acquired a sack factory in the Czech Republic.</p>
<p>The price of the deal was not given.  </p>
<p>After the completion of currently ongoing investments, the Czech mill, Apex International s.r.o. would have an annual output capacity of 50 million sacks, UPM-Kymmene said.</p>
<p>The mill's production is marketed to domestic clients in the cement and building industries, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom   +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
